  "custom_logic_notes": "BuyOne/SellOne boolean flags implement a one-trade-per-signal gate: after a buy is placed, BuyOne=false and SellOne=true, preventing consecutive buys until a sell signal occurs (and vice versa). PositionSelect(Symbol()) checks for any open position on the current symbol before entry. Entry conditions use bar[1] values (previous completed bar), not current bar[0]. MACD uses signal_period=1 which effectively makes it a single MACD line with minimal smoothing. The MA-75 and MA-85 are both LWMA applied to LOW price, while MA-5 is EMA applied to CLOSE.",
