  "python_conversion_notes": "Straightforward conversion. All indicators are standard (EMA, LWMA, MACD). Use ta-lib or pandas-ta for indicator computation. Digit adjustment logic (multiply SL/TP by 10 for 5-digit brokers) must be replicated. The BuyOne/SellOne flag logic is stateful and must be maintained across bars. Entry signals evaluate on bar[1] (previous completed bar) — typical for new-bar EAs. MACD with signal_period=1 is unusual; verify library supports signal_period=1 or compute manually. Position check uses Symbol() which in Python maps to checking if any position exists for the current symbol. No pending orders, no trailing stops, no partial closes — simple market entries with fixed SL/TP.",
